scores = 90, 65, 70, 65
show length of scores
show items in scores until position (length of scores)
names = "Ada", "Bbn", "Cy"
show length of names
show whether length of names greater_than 2
total = 0
repeat length of scores times:
    total becomes total plus value at position current_round in scores
end_of repeat
show total
show whether average value in scores is (sum of scores divided_by length of scores)
length = 7
show length
